WEBVTT

01:09.785 --> 01:14.285
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

01:15.124 --> 01:18.585
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

01:20.337 --> 01:24.837
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

01:25.509 --> 01:29.346
<i>But I will never give in</i>

01:29.430 --> 01:33.930
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

01:41.191 --> 01:45.691
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

01:54.288 --> 01:58.788
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

02:00.252 --> 02:04.752
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

02:07.343 --> 02:10.471
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

02:10.512 --> 02:15.012
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

02:15.768 --> 02:20.268
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

02:29.698 --> 02:34.077
EPISODE 18
VERSO VENEZIA!

03:02.398 --> 03:03.524
THIS IS TURTLE SHIT…

03:38.058 --> 03:39.809
DICKHEAD
I'll KILL YOU…
EAT YOUR HEART OUT…

05:59.408 --> 06:01.326
BURN BURN BURN BURN
BURN BURN BURN… ING…!

15:12.627 --> 15:14.295
BONK

23:38.466 --> 23:42.052
EPISODE 19
WHITE ICE
